Here’s the final MCP config:

MCP Providers

{
  "mcp": {
    "providers": {
      "github": {
        "type": "context",
        "sources": ["pull_request", "branch", "file"],
        "max_tokens": 200000
      },
      "local": {
        "type": "context",
        "sources": ["workspace", "cache"]
      }
    }
  }
}

MCP Context Rules

{
  "mcp": {
    "context_rules": {
      "include": [
        "src/**/*.ts",
        "src/**/*.py",
        "config/**/*.json",
        "docs/**/*.md"
      ],
      "exclude": [
        "node_modules/**",
        "dist/**",
        "build/**"
      ]
    }
  }
}

MCP Runtime

{
  "mcp": {
    "runtime": {
      "mode": "hybrid",
      "embedding_engine": "alfeon-eho-v1",
      "reasoning_engine": "alfeon-damotis-v2",
      "cache": true
    }
  }
}

This ties directly into your saved ALFEON character designs (Eho + Damotis) and Hybrid architecture.

